{% comment %}
  BOM Radar — TRMNL Private Plugin template.

  Paste this YAML into the Private Plugin's form fields box, then paste
  this file into the Markup box (Full layout tab, reached via "Edit
  Markup" after saving the plugin with the fields below):

    - keyname: location
      field_type: select
      name: Radar location
      options:
      - "Adelaide (Buckland Park), SA": "64"
      - "Adelaide (Sellicks Hill), SA": "46"
      - "Albany, WA": "31"
      - "Alice Springs, NT": "25"
      - "Bairnsdale, VIC": "68"
